<title>UK: EIB prices 500 million stg June 2002 bond, +2 bp.</title>
<headline>EIB prices 500 million stg June 2002 bond, +2 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by joint lead managers BZW and Salomon Brothers, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    07.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.466   PAY DATE  S-05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    98.841    SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT JUNE 2002 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES    S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
